            {
              "kind": "Paragraph",
              "fields": {
                "items": [
                  {
                    "kind": "leaf",
                    "token": "\"RegionReplyは[全表示/ぜんひょうじ]regionと[選択/せんたく]index、またはtyped Invalid/Stopped、Usage-only Report、[明示/めいじ]source[閉包/へいほう]を[返/かえ]す。\""
